{"candidateAnswer":"In early August 2023","evidence":"[D29:2 | 8:06 pm on 9 August, 2023] John: Hey Maria! Congrats on the recognition! It's really touching to see how much you're doing to help out. Last weekend, I participated in a community event to raise money for a good cause. We got a great turnout and it was amazing to be surrounded by so many supportive people.\n[D29:4 | 8:06 pm on 9 August, 2023] John: I set up a 5K charity run in our neighborhood. It was all for a good cause - to help out veterans and their families. We were able to raise some funds! Here's a pic from the day.","itemId":"urn:uuid:e2d8e182-bff1-5d4e-aab9-6ef73797c0e5","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:37c10324bf98efe8b896c4512a1143f1ff2e9763f04c9e12719e40eb57e49ed5","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"When did John participate in a 5K charity run?","referenceAnswer":"first weekend of August 2023","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"37c10324bf98efe8b896c4512a1143f1ff2e9763f04c9e12719e40eb57e49ed5"}}]}